font color="gray">bɹæɪ̯k bæːd</font>/<br>
<div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to go wrong, to turn toward immorality or crime<ol><li><div>descarriarse</div></li><li><div>desvirtuarse</div></li><li><div>echarse a perder</div></li><li><div>irse cuesta abajo</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>eat a meal, especially shared<div>compartir el pan</div></li><li>take part in Holy Communion<div>comulgar</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to become weak and ineffective<ol><li><div>debilitarse</div></li><li><div>deteriorarse</div></li></ol></li><li>to decay<ol><li><div>descomponerse</div></li><li><div>echarse a perder</div></li></ol></li><li>to cease to function; (other than above)<ol><li><div>descomponerse</div></li><li><div>estropearse</div></li><li><div>fallar</div></li><li><div>romperse</div></li><li><div>averiarse</div></li><li><div>lagarearse</div></li></ol></li><li>(machine) to stop functioning<ol><li><div>descomponerse</div></li><li><div>romperse</div></li><li><div>averiarse</div></li><li><div>malograrse</div></li></ol></li><li>to divide into parts for analysis<ol><li><div>desglosar</div></li><li><div>diseccionar</div></li></ol></li><li>to become unstable or collapse, mentally or otherwise<div>transtornarse</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to neither gain nor lose money<ol><li><div>cubrir gastos</div></li><li><div>no tener pérdidas</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to make something new function well through use<ol><li><div>ablandar</div></li><li><div>ahormar</div></li><li><div>domar</div></li><li><div>estrenar</div></li></ol></li><li>to tame (a horse or other animal)<div>domar</div></li><li>to enter by force or illicitly<ol><li><div>irrumpir</div></li><li><div>descerrajar</div></li><li><div>violentar</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to enter illegally<ol><li><div>descerrajar</div></li><li><div>forzar la entrada</div></li><li><div>irrumpir</div></li><li><div>violentar</div></li></ol></li><li>to begin suddenly<div>romper</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to lose traction<div>perder tracción</div></li><li>to escape; to free oneself<div>soltarse</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>To initiate a new venture<div>abrir brecha</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>(intransitive) to end abruptly<div>interrumpir</div></li><li>(transitive) to discontinue abruptly<div>terminar</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>archaic: to eat breakfast<div>desayunar</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to escape, especially forcefully or defiantly<ol><li><div>escapar forzadamente</div></li><li><div>escaparse</div></li><li><div>fugarse</div></li><li><div>salirse</div></li></ol></li><li>to begin suddenly; to emerge in a certain condition<ol><li><div>estallar</div></li><li><div>desatarse</div></li><li><div>desencadenarse</div></li><li><div>irrumpir</div></li><li><div>prorrumpir</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>march out of the designated order<div>romper filas</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to cause a person to feel grief or sadness<ol><li><div>partir el alma</div></li><li><div>partirle a alguien el corazón</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>exhaust one's financial resources<div>arruinarse</div></li><li>win all the money that is available to be paid<div>hacer saltar la banca</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>direct communication with the viewer or reader<div>romper la cuarta pared</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">ˈbɹeɪk ði ˈaɪs</font>/<br>
